      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 3.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.03,
      "end_seconds": 10.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "so, yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.69,
      "end_seconds": 17.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "I wanted to to get a bit tired sometimes looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.04,
      "end_seconds": 22.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.1,
      "end_seconds": 33.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.38,
      "text": "I take metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day. I'm on sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.98,
      "end_seconds": 39.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.79,
      "end_seconds": 42.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Probably two weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.45,
      "end_seconds": 46.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.34,
      "end_seconds": 51.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Mild, really. Mm, I've also had being vegetarian"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.36,
      "end_seconds": 55.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.17,
      "end_seconds": 67.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "Maybe a eight out of ten on a bad day. I, I had brittle nails before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.06,
      "end_seconds": 78.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "How about heavy periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.56,
      "end_seconds": 82.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "no, none, no heavy periods"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.39,
      "end_seconds": 87.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "a few quick ones: breathlessness, black stools or dizziness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.28,
      "end_seconds": 93.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I haven't had breathlessness, black stools or dizziness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.44,
      "end_seconds": 99.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "so, anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.02,
      "end_seconds": 103.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.3,
      "end_seconds": 108.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.71,
      "end_seconds": 114.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Heart failure, for about ten years. I've had migraines, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.81,
      "end_seconds": 122.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Right, so heart failure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.16,
      "end_seconds": 133.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.17,
      "end_seconds": 139.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Just a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.34,
      "end_seconds": 142.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.02,
      "end_seconds": 146.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.6,
      "end_seconds": 148.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.17,
      "end_seconds": 156.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.35,
      "end_seconds": 159.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.73,
      "end_seconds": 163.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.45,
      "end_seconds": 167.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.47,
      "end_seconds": 181.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.25,
      "end_seconds": 216.88,
      "duration_seconds": 14.63,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 125 over 75, height 184 centimetres, heart rate 66, BMI works out to 28.1, temperature is 36.9 degrees, weight 95 kilos, saturation 97 percent, respiratory rate 14."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.23,
      "end_seconds": 222.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.35,
      "end_seconds": 224.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.78,
      "end_seconds": 243.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "your pulse and blood pressure are normal and the eyelids are a good colour"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.78,
      "end_seconds": 249.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.63,
      "end_seconds": 288.16,
      "duration_seconds": 28.53,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I'd lean towards mildly low iron stores risk from diet. We should do a ferritin level for tiredness. Eat pulses, leafy greens and vitamin-C rich foods with meals. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.45,
      "end_seconds": 299.65,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "I'd like you back after the results let me check I've been clear what will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.95,
      "end_seconds": 306.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.07,
      "end_seconds": 312.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.78,
      "end_seconds": 318.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.2,
      "end_seconds": 320.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
